Hi {{contact.first_name}},

Thanks for reaching out to {{location.name}}. I have what you sent over and I'll be the one helping you.

The quickest next step is a short call. Pick a time that works for you here: {{custom_values.booking_link}}

If you'd rather write, just reply to this email.

{{user.first_name}}

Hi {{contact.first_name}},

To make the call worth your time, it helps to know two things: what you'd like to get done, and when you'd like it done by. Reply with a line on each, or book a time and we'll cover it there: {{custom_values.booking_link}}

{{user.first_name}}
